B.bjJ=s(["Adr\xe8s aplikasyon Web la pa otorize sou s\xe8v\xe8 a.","L\u2019origine de l\u2019application Web n\u2019est pas autoris\xe9e sur le serveur.","The web application origin is not allowed by the server."],t.s)
B.bpb=s(["Yon l\xf2t moun modifye sal la. Lis la pral rafrechi; verifye li anvan ou eseye ank\xf2.","La salle a \xe9t\xe9 modifi\xe9e ailleurs. La liste va \xeatre actualis\xe9e ; v\xe9rifiez-la avant de r\xe9essayer.","The gym was changed elsewhere. The list will refresh; review it before trying again."],t.s)
