B.bK7=s(["Senkronizasyon t\xe8minal la echwe. Verifye agent la ak kab rezo a.","\xc9chec de la synchronisation. V\xe9rifiez l\u2019agent et le c\xe2ble r\xe9seau.","Terminal sync failed. Check the agent and the network cable."],t.s)
